title Place Order (Checkout) - Sequence Diagram

actor Customer
participant "React Web App" as Web
participant "CheckoutController" as Ctrl
participant "CheckoutService" as Svc
participant "PaymentService" as Pay
participant "Repositories" as Repo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Customer->Web: Submit checkout
Web->Ctrl: POST /api/checkout
Ctrl->Svc: CheckoutAsync(cart, shipping, payments)

Svc->Repo: getActiveCart(cart)
Repo->DB: query cart and listings
DB-->Repo: cart and listings
Repo-->Svc: active cart

note over Svc: Verify customer, shipping,\navailability, stock and payment total

Svc->Repo: createOrder(shipping, totals)
Repo->DB: insert address and order
Repo-->Svc: order

Svc->Pay: RecordCheckoutPaymentAsync(order, payment)
Pay->Repo: addPayment(payment)
Repo->DB: insert payment with Pending status
Repo-->Pay: payment recorded
Pay-->Svc: PaymentDto

Svc->Repo: createOrderItemsAndDeductStock(order, items)
Repo->DB: insert order items\nupdate listing stock

Svc->Repo: convertCart(cart)
Repo->DB: update cart status

Svc->Repo: SaveChanges()
Repo->DB: commit changes

Svc-->Ctrl: CheckoutResponse
Ctrl-->Web: 201 Created
Web-->Customer: Show confirmation